---
title: Handmade Pasta Carbonara
cooklang: 2
servings: 4
cuisine: Italian
source: recipe-pack dinner-8/7201-handmade-pasta-carbonara-3
---

= Pasta -> fresh pasta

`Mound` @flour{300%g} into a well on a #work surface{}, `sprinkle` @sea salt{1%tsp} over it and
`crack` @eggs{4} and @olive oil{1%tbsp} into the well.

`Beat` the @&eggs{} with a #fork{} and `incorporate` the @&flour{} gradually.

`Knead` for ~{10%minutes} until ~{elastic and uniform in colour}. -> dough

`Wrap` the @&dough{} in #plastic wrap{} and `rest` ~rest{30-40%minutes}.

`Roll` the @&dough{} thin and `cut` it into tagliatelle.

= Carbonara -> carbonara

`Render low` @guanciale{100%g}(cubed) in a #frying pan{} over low heat, then `cook medium` over medium heat,
stirring, until ~{browned}.

`Mix` @&eggs{3}, @pecorino{50%g}(grated), @parmesan{50%g}(grated) and @black pepper{} in a #bowl{}.
-> egg mix

`Boil` the @&fresh pasta{} in a #pot{} of @-salted water:water{3%l} for ~{2-5%minutes} until ~{al dente}.

`Drain` the @&fresh pasta{}, reserving some of the cooking water. -> fresh pasta + pasta water{250%ml}

`Add off` the @&fresh pasta{} to the #&frying pan{} off the heat, then `add` the @&egg mix{} with a
splash of the @&pasta water{60%ml} to the #&frying pan{} and `toss` vigorously until ~{emulsified}.

`Serve` immediately with more @?pecorino{} and @?black pepper{}.
